    <string name="perm_guard_title">App detection (required)</string>
    <string name="perm_guard_desc">Turn on the Tumbler lock guard in Accessibility settings. It only notices which app comes to the front so it can lock the ones you chose. It cannot read your screen, and nothing leaves your phone. If the switch is greyed out: App info, menu, Allow restricted settings.</string>
